        "action_date": "2025-03-27",
        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p><strong>Freedom from Unfair Gun Taxes Act of 2025</strong></p><p>This bill prohibits a state&nbsp;or any political subdivision of a state from imposing or collecting an excise tax on the sale&nbsp;of a firearm, ammunition, or any part or component of a firearm or ammunition by a manufacture or dealer.&nbsp;</p>",
